/simulation/g1_cooling_demo/runs/** -text
/simulation/g1_cooling_demo/runs/dex3_station_carry_*/policy_source/** -whitespace
/simulation/g1_cooling_demo/runs/dex3_station_carry_*/actor_bundle/model/policy/** -whitespace
